#: ../developer/architecture.md:1
msgid "Architecture"
msgstr "架构"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:3
msgid ""
"HybridInference is a FastAPI gateway that speaks the OpenAI and "
"OpenRouter HTTP APIs. It sends each request to a local inference server "
"(vLLM, SGLang, Ollama or anything else OpenAI-compatible) or to a hosted "
"API. The client names a *model id*; the gateway decides which *endpoint* "
"serves it. That split lets one client call be load-balanced, failed over,"
" priced and logged across machines you own and machines you rent."
msgstr ""
"HybridInference 是一个 FastAPI 网关，对外提供 OpenAI 和 OpenRouter 的 HTTP "
"API。它把每个请求发给本地推理服务器（vLLM、SGLang、Ollama 或其他任何兼容 OpenAI 的服务），或者发给托管 "
"API。客户端指定*模型 "
"id*，由网关决定哪个*端点*来提供服务。正因为两者分开，同一个客户端调用可以在自有机器和租用机器之间做负载均衡、故障转移、计价和记录日志。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:10
msgid ""
"The backend lives under `apps/backend/` and imports as two top-level "
"packages (`pyproject.toml` sets `apps/backend` as the import root):"
msgstr ""
"后端代码位于 `apps/backend/`，以两个顶层包的形式导入（`pyproject.toml` 把 `apps/backend` "
"设为导入根目录）："

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "Directory"
msgstr "目录"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "Responsibility"
msgstr "职责"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "`apps/backend/serving/`"
msgstr "`apps/backend/serving/`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid ""
"HTTP surface, authentication and quota, request schemas, provider "
"adapters, storage, observability"
msgstr "HTTP 接口、认证与配额、请求 schema、provider adapter、存储、可观测性"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "`apps/backend/routing/`"
msgstr "`apps/backend/routing/`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "Route table, router strategies, endpoint health, circuit breaker, fallback"
msgstr "路由表、router 策略、端点健康状态、熔断器、回退"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:18
msgid "Design principles"
msgstr "设计原则"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:20
msgid ""
"**One model id, many endpoints.** Clients name a model; the gateway picks"
" the machine."
msgstr "**一个模型 id，多个端点**。客户端指定模型，由网关选择机器。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:22
msgid ""
"**Route around failure instead of retrying into it.** A non-idempotent "
"generation is never re-sent with the same key. Resilience comes from key "
"rotation, the fallback chain and the circuit breaker."
msgstr "**绕开故障，而不是硬着头皮重试**。非幂等的生成请求绝不会用同一个 key 重发。可靠性来自 key 轮换、回退链和熔断器。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:25
msgid ""
"**A caller learns nothing it is not entitled to.** Every access failure "
"is the same `404`, and upstream errors are scrubbed before they reach a "
"client."
msgstr "**调用方得不到无权知道的信息**。所有访问失败都返回同样的 `404`，上游错误在到达客户端之前会被清理。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:27
msgid ""
"**Configuration belongs to the deployment.** A deployment configures its "
"model registry, routing policy and branding in Admin, which stores them "
"in PostgreSQL. See [Configuration](#configuration)."
msgstr ""
"**配置属于部署**。部署在 Admin 中配置自己的模型注册表、路由策略和品牌，这些都存放在 PostgreSQL "
"中。见[配置](#configuration)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:30
msgid ""
"**Extension points are declarative.** A new provider needs a `kind` and, "
"if its API is not OpenAI-compatible, an adapter. A new routing strategy "
"is a module in `apps/backend/routing/strategies/` that registers itself. "
"Neither touches the request handler."
msgstr ""
"**扩展点是声明式的**。新的 provider 需要一个 `kind`，如果它的 API 不兼容 OpenAI，还需要一个 "
"adapter。新的路由策略是 `apps/backend/routing/strategies/` "
"下一个自行注册的模块。两者都不用改动请求处理代码。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:35
msgid "The four layers"
msgstr "四个层次"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:77
msgid ""
"How public traffic reaches the gateway (proxy, CDN, the console's "
"rewrites) is in [The public path table](public-path-table.md)."
msgstr "公网流量如何到达网关（代理、CDN、控制台的路径重写）见[公开路径表](public-path-table.md)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:80
msgid "Request lifecycle"
msgstr "请求生命周期"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:82
msgid ""
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/routers/completions.py` (chat completions) "
"is the reference path; the other inference surfaces reuse its parts."
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/routers/completions.py`（chat "
"completions）是参考路径，其他推理接口复用它的各个部分。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:85
msgid "1. Middleware"
msgstr "1\\. 中间件"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:87
msgid ""
"`create_app()` in `apps/backend/serving/servers/app.py` registers ten "
"middlewares. From the outside in:"
msgstr "`apps/backend/serving/servers/app.py` 中的 `create_app()` 注册了十个中间件。从外到内依次是："

#: ../developer/architecture.md:90
msgid "`NoSniffMiddleware`: adds `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`."
msgstr "`NoSniffMiddleware`：添加 `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff`。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:91
msgid ""
"`HandoffMiddleware`: counts requests for a release handoff and refuses "
"new ones with `503` once the process is sealed; see [Handing traffic to a"
" new gateway process](deployment.md#handing-traffic-to-a-new-gateway-"
"process)."
msgstr ""
"`HandoffMiddleware`：为发布交接统计请求，进程封存后用 `503` "
"拒绝新请求；见[把流量交给新的网关进程](deployment.md#handing-traffic-to-a-new-gateway-"
"process)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:94
msgid "`RequestIdMiddleware`: the request id on every log line."
msgstr "`RequestIdMiddleware`：提供每行日志都带的请求 id。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:95
msgid "`FallbackErrorMiddleware`: shapes errors nothing else handled."
msgstr "`FallbackErrorMiddleware`：整理其他环节都没处理的错误。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:96
msgid ""
"`KubernetesProxyTrustMiddleware`: discovers which proxies may report the "
"client address, when Kubernetes discovery is configured."
msgstr "`KubernetesProxyTrustMiddleware`：配置了 Kubernetes 发现时，找出哪些代理可以上报客户端地址。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:98
msgid "`RequestLogMiddleware`: one structured log record per request."
msgstr "`RequestLogMiddleware`：每个请求一条结构化日志记录。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:99
msgid ""
"`TimeoutMiddleware`: `REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` (default 120) for ordinary"
" requests, `STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` (default 3600; `0` or less "
"removes the cap) once the response is streaming."
msgstr ""
"`TimeoutMiddleware`：普通请求使用 `REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`（默认 120），响应开始流式传输后使用 "
"`STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`（默认 3600；`0` 或更小表示不设上限）。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:102
msgid ""
"`SettingsCORSMiddleware`: CORS, reading `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` per "
"request."
msgstr "`SettingsCORSMiddleware`：处理 CORS，每个请求都重新读取 `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS`。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:103
msgid ""
"`TrailingSlashRedirectMiddleware`: `308` from a `/v1/…/` or "
"`/anthropic/…/` path to the same path without the slash; see [The "
"trailing-slash interaction](public-path-table.md#the-trailing-slash-"
"interaction)."
msgstr ""
"`TrailingSlashRedirectMiddleware`：把以斜杠结尾的 `/v1/…/` 或 `/anthropic/…/` 路径用 "
"`308` 重定向到去掉斜杠的同一路径；见[末尾斜杠的相互影响](public-path-table.md#the-trailing-slash-"
"interaction)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:106
msgid ""
"`RequestBodyLimitMiddleware`: `413` for a body over `REQUEST_MAX_BODY_MB`"
" (default 32 MiB), checked against `Content-Length` and again as bytes "
"arrive. Batch uploads use `BATCH_MAX_BODY_MB` instead. Control routes get"
" 256 KiB (`/auth/`, `/user/`, `/internal/`, `/v1/identity/`, "
"`/v1/batch_webhook`) or 1 MiB (`/admin/`), because FastAPI decodes a body"
" before authentication runs. The few routes that need a large body read "
"it only after authentication."
msgstr ""
"`RequestBodyLimitMiddleware`：请求体超过 `REQUEST_MAX_BODY_MB`（默认 32 MiB）时返回 "
"`413`，先按 `Content-Length` 检查，字节到达时再检查一次。批量上传改用 "
"`BATCH_MAX_BODY_MB`。控制类路由的上限是 256 "
"KiB（`/auth/`、`/user/`、`/internal/`、`/v1/identity/`、`/v1/batch_webhook`）或 "
"1 MiB（`/admin/`），因为 FastAPI 会在认证之前解码请求体。少数需要大请求体的路由只在认证之后才读取它。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:114
msgid ""
"Never add a middleware that buffers response bodies: it breaks Server-"
"Sent Events streaming."
msgstr "不要添加会缓冲响应体的中间件：它会破坏 Server-Sent Events 流式传输。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:117
msgid ""
"`HTTP_IDLE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS` (default 600; `0` turns it off) closes an "
"accepted connection that sends no bytes in either direction for that "
"long, including a client that never finishes its headers. Uvicorn's keep-"
"alive timer does not cover that case. The value stays above the request "
"and stream timeouts, so a slow prefill still gets a `504`, not a dropped "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"`HTTP_IDLE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`（默认 600；`0` "
"表示关闭）会关闭在这段时间内双向都没有字节传输的已接受连接，包括始终没发完请求头的客户端。Uvicorn 的 keep-alive "
"计时器不覆盖这种情况。这个值高于请求超时和流超时，所以预填充较慢时仍然会得到 `504`，而不是连接被断开。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:123
msgid "2. Authentication and quota"
msgstr "2\\. 认证与配额"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:125
msgid ""
"`verify_api_key` (`apps/backend/serving/servers/auth.py`) runs on every "
"inference endpoint and checks, in order:"
msgstr "`verify_api_key`（`apps/backend/serving/servers/auth.py`）在每个推理端点上运行，按顺序检查："

#: ../developer/architecture.md:128
msgid ""
"**Agent grant tokens**, a separate credential namespace. A grant works "
"only on inference paths; anything else gets `403 insufficient_scope`."
msgstr "**Agent 授权令牌**，这是一个独立的凭据命名空间。授权只能用于推理路径，其他路径一律返回 `403 insufficient_scope`。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:130
msgid ""
"**Auth disabled.** With `USER_AUTH_ENABLED` false, the caller is an "
"anonymous admin. Authentication is on unless explicitly turned off."
msgstr "**认证已关闭**。`USER_AUTH_ENABLED` 为 false 时，调用方被当作匿名管理员。除非明确关闭，认证默认开启。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:132
msgid ""
"**API key.** Keys look like `hyi-<token>` and are stored only as an HMAC-"
"SHA256 digest keyed by `API_KEY_SECRET`. Send one as `Authorization: "
"Bearer …` or `X-API-Key`."
msgstr ""
"**API key**。key 的形式是 `hyi-<token>`，只以 `API_KEY_SECRET` 为密钥的 HMAC-SHA256 "
"摘要存储。可以通过 `Authorization: Bearer …` 或 `X-API-Key` 发送。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:136
msgid ""
"It also enforces the key's budgets and the project's and account's "
"quotas, answering `429` from one shared builder "
"(`apps/backend/serving/quota.py`). `enforce_user_concurrency` then holds "
"a per-user in-flight slot for the whole request. It reads the body first "
"(a concurrency-exempt model draws on its own budget), and a caller may "
"have at most four bodies being read at once."
msgstr ""
"它还会执行 key 的预算以及项目和账户的配额，超限时用同一个构造函数（`apps/backend/serving/quota.py`）返回 "
"`429`。之后 `enforce_user_concurrency` "
"会在整个请求期间占用一个按用户计的并发槽位。它会先读取请求体（不受并发限制的模型使用单独的额度），每个调用方同时最多只能有四个请求体在读取。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:142
msgid ""
"The quota check reads the counter tables (`user_daily_cost`, "
"`api_key_daily_cost`). The spend ledger "
"(`apps/backend/serving/spend_ledger.py`) adds what they do not show yet:"
msgstr "配额检查读取计数表（`user_daily_cost`、`api_key_daily_cost`）。消费账本（`apps/backend/serving/spend_ledger.py`）补上计数表尚未反映的部分："

#: ../developer/architecture.md:146
msgid ""
"**Requests in flight.** Admission reserves each request's estimated cost "
"and releases it when the request ends. A request is refused only when not"
" even `ESTIMATED_REQUEST_COST_USD` fits; an admitted one reserves up to "
"`MAX_RESERVED_REQUEST_COST_USD`, so concurrent requests cannot all spend "
"the same remaining budget."
msgstr ""
"**进行中的请求**。准入时为每个请求预留估算费用，请求结束时释放。只有连 `ESTIMATED_REQUEST_COST_USD` "
"都放不下时才拒绝请求；被准入的请求最多预留 `MAX_RESERVED_REQUEST_COST_USD`，所以并发请求不会都去花同一笔剩余预算。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:151
msgid ""
"**Costs not yet written.** One writer per store adds finished costs to "
"the counters in batches. The ledger keeps counting a cost until its write"
" is confirmed, so the delay never lets a request past a limit."
msgstr "**尚未写入的费用**。每个存储由一个写入者把已完成请求的费用分批加到计数器上。在写入确认之前，账本会一直计入这笔费用，所以写入延迟不会让请求越过限额。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:155
msgid ""
"A cost the counters refuse (for example one that would overflow) is "
"logged as `cost_counter_write_refused` and alerted for an operator to "
"reconcile. One request adds at most $1,000; a larger cost is capped and "
"logged as `cost_above_request_ceiling`."
msgstr ""
"计数器拒绝的费用（例如会溢出的值）会记为 `cost_counter_write_refused` "
"并发出告警，由运维人员核对处理。单个请求最多计入 $1,000；更大的费用会被截断并记为 "
"`cost_above_request_ceiling`。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:160
msgid ""
"The ledger is per process, so limits hold within each worker but not "
"across workers; production runs one. A shared spend mode, off unless an "
"operator turns it on, keeps reservations in PostgreSQL for all processes;"
" see [Shared accounting and draining](accounting.md#shared-accounting-"
"and-draining)."
msgstr ""
"账本按进程独立，所以限额只在每个 worker 内部生效，不跨 worker；生产环境只运行一个 "
"worker。共享消费模式默认关闭，由运维人员开启后，所有进程的预留都存放在 PostgreSQL "
"中；见[共享记账与排空](accounting.md#shared-accounting-and-draining)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:165
msgid ""
"A response cut off by the client or the request timeout is billed for "
"what the upstream already did: its reported usage, or an estimate marked "
"`metadata.usage_estimated`. A request the upstream fails is not billed."
msgstr ""
"被客户端或请求超时中断的响应，按上游已经完成的部分计费：上游报告的用量，或者标记为 `metadata.usage_estimated` "
"的估算值。上游失败的请求不计费。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:169
msgid ""
"Read-only endpoints such as `/v1/models` use `optional_verify_api_key`: a"
" missing or invalid key is anonymous, and the key only decides what is "
"listed."
msgstr ""
"`/v1/models` 等只读端点使用 `optional_verify_api_key`：缺少 key 或 key 无效时按匿名处理，key "
"只决定列出哪些内容。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:172
msgid "3. Model gate"
msgstr "3\\. 模型门禁"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:174
msgid ""
"Before any provider is contacted, the handler answers `404` if the model "
"is not in the route table, is unpublished, needs a role the caller lacks,"
" was disabled for the user, or is outside the scope of the caller's key, "
"project, user tags or inference grant. All cases return the same \"model "
"not found\" body, so a caller cannot probe for models by comparing `403` "
"with `404`. The check is `model_access_denial` in "
"`apps/backend/serving/model_access.py`."
msgstr ""
"在联系任何 provider 之前，如果模型不在路由表中、尚未发布、要求调用方不具备的角色、对该用户已被禁用，或者超出调用方 "
"key、项目、用户标签或推理授权的范围，处理器都会返回 `404`。所有情况都返回同样的 \"model not found\" "
"响应体，调用方无法通过对比 `403` 和 `404` 来探测模型。这项检查是 "
"`apps/backend/serving/model_access.py` 中的 `model_access_denial`。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:181
msgid "4. Router selection"
msgstr "4\\. router 选择"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:183
msgid ""
"`ModelRouterRegistry` (`apps/backend/routing/model_router_registry.py`) "
"builds and caches one router per model from its `router` and "
"`router_params`. A model without `router` uses `default_router` from the "
"routing policy (`ROUTING_POLICY`)."
msgstr ""
"`ModelRouterRegistry`（`apps/backend/routing/model_router_registry.py`）根据每个模型的"
" `router` 和 `router_params` 为它构建并缓存一个 router。没有 `router` "
"的模型使用路由策略（`ROUTING_POLICY`）中的 `default_router`。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:188
msgid ""
"The `fixed` router drops routes with weight `0` (an admin-disabled "
"provider counts as `0`), routes that cannot take the request's media and "
"routes with an open circuit, then draws one by weight, biased away from "
"endpoints busy with prefill. A 5-minute per-caller affinity keeps a "
"conversation on the endpoint that holds its prefix cache. An admin can "
"pin a request with `X-Route-Pin: <provider-or-endpoint-id>`; pinned "
"requests never fall back. See [How `FixedRouter` picks an "
"endpoint](routing.md#how-fixedrouter-picks-an-endpoint)."
msgstr ""
"`fixed` router 先去掉权重为 `0` 的路由（被管理员禁用的 provider 算作 "
"`0`）、无法接收请求中媒体的路由和熔断器已打开的路由，再按权重抽取一条，并避开正忙于预填充的端点。按调用方维持 5 "
"分钟的亲和性，让同一个对话留在持有其前缀缓存的端点上。管理员可以用 `X-Route-Pin: <provider-or-endpoint-"
"id>` 固定请求；被固定的请求从不回退。见[`FixedRouter` 如何选择端点](routing.md#how-fixedrouter-"
"picks-an-endpoint)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:196
msgid "5. Dispatch, fallback, and the circuit breaker"
msgstr "5\\. 分发、回退与熔断器"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:198
msgid ""
"The router calls the adapter it chose through a thin wrapper, so an admin"
" edit cannot redirect a request already on its way. On success the "
"response carries an internal `_routing` block (provider, base URL, "
"`endpoint_id`). On failure the router tries the model's remaining routes "
"in order; every attempt is recorded in `failed_attempts` for the request "
"log, and if all fail the client gets the *primary* error."
msgstr ""
"router 通过一层薄包装调用它选中的 adapter，所以管理员的修改不会改变已经在途的请求。成功时，响应带有内部的 `_routing` "
"块（provider、base URL、`endpoint_id`）。失败时，router 按顺序尝试模型的其余路由；每次尝试都记录在 "
"`failed_attempts` 中供请求日志使用，如果全部失败，客户端收到的是*主*路由的错误。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:205
msgid ""
"Each `endpoint_id` has a circuit breaker "
"(`apps/backend/routing/endpoint_health.py`). Client errors other than "
"408, 429, 401 and 407 never trip it: 408 and 429 mean overload, and 401 "
"and 407 reject the gateway's own credential. Thresholds and the per-"
"caller rule are in [Endpoint health and circuit breaking](routing.md"
"#endpoint-health-and-circuit-breaking)."
msgstr ""
"每个 `endpoint_id` 都有一个熔断器（`apps/backend/routing/endpoint_health.py`）。除 "
"408、429、401 和 407 之外的客户端错误永远不会触发它：408 和 429 表示过载，401 和 407 "
"表示网关自己的凭据被拒。阈值和按调用方区分的规则见[端点健康与熔断](routing.md#endpoint-health-and-"
"circuit-breaking)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:211
msgid "6. Logging"
msgstr "6\\. 日志"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:213
msgid ""
"`CompletionsLogger` "
"(`apps/backend/serving/servers/routers/completions_logging.py`) writes "
"the `api_logs` row in the background and hands a `RoutingObservation` "
"back to the router. `FixedRouter` ignores it; learning routers update "
"their cost model."
msgstr ""
"`CompletionsLogger`（`apps/backend/serving/servers/routers/completions_logging.py`）在后台写入"
" `api_logs` 记录，并把一个 `RoutingObservation` 交回 router。`FixedRouter` 忽略它；会学习的"
" router 用它更新成本模型。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:218
msgid "The routing engine in detail"
msgstr "路由引擎详解"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:223
msgid "Routers and strategies"
msgstr "router 与策略"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "Module in `apps/backend/routing/strategies/`"
msgstr "`apps/backend/routing/strategies/` 中的模块"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "What it is"
msgstr "它是什么"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "`fixed.py`"
msgstr "`fixed.py`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid ""
"The `fixed` strategy: weighted-random selection with fallback, "
"implemented by `FixedRouter` in `apps/backend/routing/routers.py`"
msgstr ""
"`fixed` 策略：带回退的加权随机选择，由 `apps/backend/routing/routers.py` 中的 "
"`FixedRouter` 实现"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "`routewise.py`"
msgstr "`routewise.py`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid ""
"The `routewise` strategy: a cost-aware router that learns from "
"`RoutingObservation` feedback, implemented under "
"`apps/backend/routing/routewise/`"
msgstr ""
"`routewise` 策略：一个考虑成本、从 `RoutingObservation` 反馈中学习的 router，实现在 "
"`apps/backend/routing/routewise/` 下"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "`weight.py`"
msgstr "`weight.py`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid ""
"Not a per-model router. `FixedRatioStrategy` splits a weight budget "
"between local and remote endpoint groups for `RoutingManager`"
msgstr "不是按模型的 router。`FixedRatioStrategy` 为 `RoutingManager` 在本地和远程端点组之间分配权重预算"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:231
msgid ""
"`router` accepts `fixed` or `routewise`; any other name is refused when "
"the catalog or routing policy is saved. Each strategy's params model sets"
" `extra=\"forbid\"`, so a typo in `router_params` is refused rather than "
"ignored. To add one, see [Adding a routing strategy](routing.md#adding-a"
"-routing-strategy)."
msgstr ""
"`router` 接受 `fixed` 或 `routewise`；保存模型目录或路由策略时，其他名称都会被拒绝。每个策略的参数模型都设置了 "
"`extra=\"forbid\"`，所以 `router_params` "
"中的拼写错误会被拒绝，而不是被忽略。要添加新策略，见[添加路由策略](routing.md#adding-a-routing-strategy)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:236
msgid "Two layers of \"strategy\""
msgstr "两层「策略」"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:253
msgid ""
"`RoutingManager` rewrites weights from the routing policy's local/remote "
"split once at startup, and only when `default_router` is `fixed`. A "
"gateway with a database still runs it, but selects from the catalog "
"weights plus Admin overrides, so the rewrite has no effect there; see "
"[Routes excluded from selection](routing.md#routes-excluded-from-"
"selection)."
msgstr ""
"`RoutingManager` 在启动时按路由策略中的本地/远程划分改写一次权重，而且只在 `default_router` 为 `fixed`"
" 时改写。有数据库的网关仍会运行它，但选择路由时使用的是模型目录中的权重加上 Admin "
"的覆盖值，所以这次改写在那里不起作用；见[被排除在选择之外的路由](routing.md#routes-excluded-from-"
"selection)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:259
msgid "Execution and composition"
msgstr "执行与组合"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:266
msgid "`provider` versus `endpoint_id`"
msgstr "`provider` 与 `endpoint_id`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:268
msgid ""
"`provider` is a label on the route. It defaults to the adapter kind and "
"can be overridden per route. `api_logs.provider`, per-provider dashboards"
" and the admin disable switch all use it. A route may not borrow a label "
"that belongs to an adapter kind."
msgstr ""
"`provider` 是路由上的标签。它默认等于 adapter kind，可以按路由覆盖。`api_logs.provider`、按 "
"provider 统计的仪表盘和管理员的禁用开关都使用它。路由不能借用属于某个 adapter kind 的标签。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:273
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`endpoint_id` identifies one endpoint of one model: "
"`{model_id}:{location}`. A host of `localhost`, `127.0.0.1`, `0.0.0.0` or"
" `host.docker.internal` gives `local-<port>` (or `local`); anything else "
"is named from the kind or hostname, for example `<model>:openrouter-api`."
" Latency profiles, availability and circuit state are keyed on it. Do not"
" read ownership from the suffix: a gateway-owned server on a LAN address "
"gets `<name>-api`, and an admin-supplied `route_id` is used as written."
msgstr ""
"`endpoint_id` 标识某个模型的一个端点：`{model_id}:{location}`。主机为 "
"`localhost`、`127.0.0.1`、`0.0.0.0` 或 `host.docker.internal` 时得到 "
"`local-<port>`（或 `local`）；其他情况按 kind 或主机名命名，例如 `<model>:openrouter-"
"api`。延迟画像、可用性和熔断状态都以它为键。不要根据后缀判断机器归属：网关自有、但位于局域网地址的服务器会得到 "
"`<name>-api`，管理员提供的 `route_id` 则原样使用。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:281
msgid "Adapters"
msgstr "adapter"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:283
msgid ""
"An adapter talks to one provider: it builds the URL and headers, holds "
"the API key or key pool, translates the request and response, normalizes "
"usage and raises errors the router understands. `_make_adapter` in "
"`apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py` builds adapters from the model"
" registry, first checking factories registered by [backend extensions"
"](backend-extensions.md)."
msgstr ""
"adapter 负责与一个 provider 通信：构造 URL 和请求头，持有 API key 或 key "
"池，转换请求和响应，规范化用量，并抛出 router "
"能理解的错误。`apps/backend/serving/servers/registry.py` 中的 `_make_adapter` "
"根据模型注册表构建 adapter，并先检查[后端扩展](backend-extensions.md)注册的工厂。"

