#: ../developer/architecture.md:298
msgid ""
"A route with `api_keys:` (a list) gets a key pool. A key that fails with "
"429, 401, 402, 403, 408, 425, a 5xx or a timeout hands the request to the"
" next key; a key is muted for 20 seconds only when no untried key is "
"left. Request errors such as 400 and 422 are not rotated, since they fail"
" on every key. A completion is never re-sent to the same key, because "
"that would bill it twice."
msgstr ""
"带 `api_keys:`（列表）的路由会得到一个 key 池。某个 key 遇到 429、401、402、403、408、425、5xx "
"或超时时，请求交给下一个 key；只有在没有未试过的 key 时，失败的 key 才会被静默 20 秒。400、422 这类请求本身的错误在每个 "
"key 上都会失败，所以不会轮换。补全请求绝不会重发给同一个 key，否则会被计费两次。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:304
msgid "Streaming timeouts"
msgstr "流式超时"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:306
msgid ""
"The gateway has to notice an upstream that stops sending but keeps the "
"socket open; otherwise every stream on that endpoint dies together when "
"an outer proxy gives up. These clocks fire in order, innermost first:"
msgstr "上游停止发送却不关闭连接时，网关必须自己发现；否则等到外层代理放弃时，该端点上的所有流会一起失败。下面这些计时器从最内层开始依次触发："

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "`STREAM_IDLE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`"
msgstr "`STREAM_IDLE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "180s"
msgstr "180 秒"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "Gap between two data-bearing SSE frames, after the first"
msgstr "首帧之后，两个带数据 SSE 帧之间的间隔"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "`STREAM_MAX_IDLE_S`"
msgstr "`STREAM_MAX_IDLE_S`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "240s"
msgstr "240 秒"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "Same gap on `/v1/messages`, counted in *forwarded* frames"
msgstr "`/v1/messages` 上的同一间隔，按*转发出去的*帧计算"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "`STREAM_MAX_FIRST_FRAME_IDLE_S`"
msgstr "`STREAM_MAX_FIRST_FRAME_IDLE_S`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "300s"
msgstr "300 秒"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "First frame on `/v1/messages`; never less than `STREAM_MAX_IDLE_S`"
msgstr "`/v1/messages` 上的第一帧；不小于 `STREAM_MAX_IDLE_S`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "`STREAM_FIRST_BYTE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`"
msgstr "`STREAM_FIRST_BYTE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "unset"
msgstr "未设置"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "Connect to first frame, i.e. prefill"
msgstr "从建连到首帧，即 prefill 阶段"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "`STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`"
msgstr "`STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "3600s"
msgstr "3600 秒"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "The whole streaming response"
msgstr "整个流式响应"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:318
msgid ""
"Prefill and inter-chunk time have separate budgets because a 1M-token "
"prompt can take minutes to reach its first token while later chunks "
"arrive milliseconds apart. `0` turns off either of the first-byte and "
"inter-chunk clocks. `/v1/messages` is looser because a buffered XML tool "
"call can hold back a forwarded frame for over a minute. An expired inter-"
"chunk budget raises `UpstreamStreamIdleError`, which counts against the "
"endpoint's circuit instead of ending the stream with a fake `[DONE]`."
msgstr ""
"预填充和数据块间隔分别计时，因为 100 万 token 的提示词可能要几分钟才出第一个 token，而之后的数据块间隔只有几毫秒。`0` "
"可以关闭首字节计时器或块间计时器。`/v1/messages` 更宽松，因为缓冲中的 XML "
"工具调用可能让一帧转发推迟一分多钟。块间时限耗尽会抛出 `UpstreamStreamIdleError`，计入该端点的熔断状态，而不是用伪造的 "
"`[DONE]` 结束流。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:326
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:328
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Application documents are validated JSON settings in `app_config`: "
"`MODEL_CATALOG`, `ROUTING_POLICY`, `ALERT_RULES`, `SITE_CONFIGURATION`, "
"`SITE_BRANDING` and `SSO_PROVIDERS`. No YAML file is read at runtime, and"
" a fresh gateway serves no models until an administrator configures it. "
"Credentials are secret settings that documents reference as `${NAME}`."
msgstr ""
"应用文档是 `app_config` 中经过校验的 JSON "
"设置项：`MODEL_CATALOG`、`ROUTING_POLICY`、`ALERT_RULES`、`SITE_CONFIGURATION`、`SITE_BRANDING`"
" 和 `SSO_PROVIDERS`。运行时不读取任何 YAML 文件，全新的网关在管理员配置之前不提供任何模型。凭据是秘密设置项，文档用 "
"`${NAME}` 引用它们。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:334
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Admin route edits apply across backend processes without a restart, and "
"requests in flight keep the router and feedback they started with. "
"Catalog, routing-policy and alert-rule changes need a restart. See "
"[Configuration](configuration.md) and the {download}`accepted design "
"<../agents/specs/2026-11-08-database-only-configuration.md>`."
msgstr ""
"在 Admin 中修改路由会在各个后端进程生效，无需重启，进行中的请求仍沿用开始时的 router "
"和反馈。修改模型目录、路由策略和告警规则需要重启。见[配置](configuration.md)和{download}`accepted "
"design <../agents/specs/2026-11-08-database-only-configuration.md>`。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:340
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "存储"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:342
msgid ""
"`apps/backend/serving/storage/base.py` defines `OperationalStore` "
"(accounts, API keys, roles, quotas, admin-managed providers and routes, "
"runtime settings) and `LogStore` (the request log). Postgres implements "
"both (`postgres_operational.py`, `postgres_log.py`); "
"`CachedOperationalStore` caches the operational store because "
"authentication reads it on every request."
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/serving/storage/base.py` 定义了 `OperationalStore`（账户、API "
"key、角色、配额、由管理员管理的 provider 和路由、运行时设置）和 `LogStore`（请求日志）。两者都由 Postgres "
"实现（`postgres_operational.py`、`postgres_log.py`）；因为每个请求的认证都要读取运行数据存储，所以由 "
"`CachedOperationalStore` 为它加缓存。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:348
msgid ""
"The schema comes only from the migrations in `apps/backend/migrations/`. "
"A deploy applies them before restarting the backend, and the backend "
"refuses to start on a database they have not reached; see "
"[Database](database.md). Useful `api_logs` columns: `request_id`, "
"`model_id`, `provider`, `served_model_id` and `served_endpoint_id` (what "
"actually answered), `ttft_ms`, `latency_ms`, token counts, `cost_usd` "
"(what the caller is billed) and `upstream_cost_usd` (what the upstream "
"reported)."
msgstr ""
"数据库结构只来自 `apps/backend/migrations/` "
"中的迁移。部署会在重启后端之前应用迁移，数据库没有迁移到位时后端拒绝启动；见[数据库](database.md)。`api_logs` "
"中常用的列：`request_id`、`model_id`、`provider`、`served_model_id` 和 "
"`served_endpoint_id`（实际响应的模型和端点）、`ttft_ms`、`latency_ms`、各项 token "
"数、`cost_usd`（向调用方收取的费用）和 `upstream_cost_usd`（上游报告的费用）。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:356
msgid ""
"With `DB_ENABLED=false` the gateway reads its documents from environment "
"values and still routes requests, without request logging or accounts. "
"Stage 1 of the [Quickstart](router-tutorial.md) runs this way."
msgstr ""
"设置 `DB_ENABLED=false` 时，网关从环境变量读取文档，仍然可以路由请求，但没有请求日志和账户。[快速开始](router-"
"tutorial.md)的第 1 阶段就是这样运行的。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:360
msgid "Observability"
msgstr "可观测性"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:362
msgid "There is no Prometheus exporter. The gateway reports through:"
msgstr "网关没有 Prometheus exporter，而是通过以下途径报告状态："

#: ../developer/architecture.md:364
msgid ""
"**Structured logs**, one record per request, formatted by "
"`apps/backend/serving/utils/logging.py`. Health-probe noise is hidden "
"unless `LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG`."
msgstr ""
"**结构化日志**，每个请求一条，由 `apps/backend/serving/utils/logging.py` 格式化。除非 "
"`LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG`，健康探测产生的噪音会被隐藏。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:367
msgid ""
"**The request log** (`api_logs`), the source for admin dashboards and "
"usage."
msgstr "**请求日志**（`api_logs`），是管理仪表盘和用量统计的数据来源。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:368
msgid ""
"**Health endpoints.** `/health` returns 200 (`status: \"degraded\"` when "
"a store is down) and 503 only when every store is unreachable. "
"`/health/ready` returns 503 unless everything is up. `/health/deep` adds "
"per-endpoint availability and circuit state. Anonymous callers see only "
"`status`; all three share one store probe for two seconds."
msgstr ""
"**健康检查端点**。`/health` 返回 200（某个存储不可用时为 `status: "
"\"degraded\"`），只有所有存储都不可达时才返回 503。`/health/ready` 只要有任何一项不可用就返回 "
"503。`/health/deep` 额外给出每个端点的可用性和熔断状态。匿名调用方只能看到 `status`；三者在两秒内共用同一次存储探测。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:373
msgid ""
"**Alerts.** `alert_slack()` and `alert_on_transition()` in "
"`apps/backend/serving/observability/alerts.py` post to one Slack or WeCom"
" webhook, set in **Admin → Settings → Operations**. Thresholds come from "
"`ALERT_RULES`. A channel change needs a restart unless the "
"`alerts.runtime` live group is active; see [Settings that apply without a"
" restart](configuration.md#settings-that-apply-without-a-restart). The "
"circuit breaker pages on `circuit_open` and on rejected upstream "
"credentials, with a cooldown per endpoint."
msgstr ""
"**告警**。`apps/backend/serving/observability/alerts.py` 中的 `alert_slack()` "
"和 `alert_on_transition()` 把告警发送到一个 Slack 或企业微信 webhook，在 **Admin → "
"Settings → Operations** 中设置。阈值来自 `ALERT_RULES`。除非 `alerts.runtime` "
"实时组已激活，更换告警渠道需要重启；见[无需重启即可生效的设置](configuration.md#settings-that-apply-"
"without-a-restart)。熔断器在 `circuit_open` 和上游凭据被拒时发出告警，每个端点有各自的冷却时间。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:381
msgid ""
"**Alert history**, on when there is a database "
"(`ALERT_HISTORY_ENABLED=false` turns it off), records every alert "
"decision without changing what is sent; see [Alert history](alert-"
"history.md)."
msgstr ""
"**告警历史**在有数据库时开启（`ALERT_HISTORY_ENABLED=false` "
"可关闭），它记录每一个告警决策，但不改变实际发送的内容；见[告警历史](alert-history.md)。"

