"`GET /v1/models`, `GET /models`, `GET /openrouter/models`, `GET "
"/anthropic/v1/models`"
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/models`, `GET /models`, `GET /openrouter/models`, `GET "
"/anthropic/v1/models`"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
msgid "Optional: a key only widens what is listed"
msgstr "可选：key 只会扩大列出的范围"

#: ../developer/architecture.md
