msgstr "视路径而定"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:402
msgid ""
"`BATCH_ENABLED` switches every batch, file and webhook route; when it is "
"off they answer `404` and no queued request starts."
msgstr "`BATCH_ENABLED` 控制所有批处理、文件和 webhook 路由；关闭时它们都返回 `404`，排队中的请求也不会开始。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:404
msgid ""
"`GET /routing` lists each published route's provider label and weight. "
"Upstream base URLs and probe results appear only with an administrator's "
"JWT or `ADMIN_TOKEN` as a bearer token; `GET /admin/routing` also lists "
"unpublished routes."
msgstr ""
"`GET /routing` 列出每条已发布路由的 provider 标签和权重。只有用管理员的 JWT 或 `ADMIN_TOKEN` 作为 "
"bearer token 时才会显示上游 base URL 和探测结果；`GET /admin/routing` 还会列出未发布的路由。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:408
msgid ""
"`/v1/models` answers an Anthropic-family client in the Anthropic shape; "
"`/models` and `/openrouter/models` always use the OpenAI shape."
msgstr ""
"`/v1/models` 对 Anthropic 系客户端返回 Anthropic 格式；`/models` 和 "
"`/openrouter/models` 始终使用 OpenAI 格式。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:410
msgid ""
"The balance probes serve the quota checks of new-api, one-api, sub2api "
"and cc-switch. They report what is left under the tightest of the daily "
"quota, the monthly quota and the key's and project's budgets "
"(`/anthropic/user/balance`: the daily quota only). Remaining is `0` "
"exactly when a request would be refused, and the answer is still HTTP "
"200."
msgstr ""
"余额探测接口服务于 new-api、one-api、sub2api 和 cc-switch 的配额检查。它们报告每日配额、每月配额以及 key "
"和项目预算中最紧的那一项还剩多少（`/anthropic/user/balance` 只看每日配额）。剩余额度恰好在请求会被拒绝时为 "
"`0`，此时仍返回 HTTP 200。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:415
msgid ""
"`GET /v1/key` shows the key's project, models, budgets and "
"`concurrency.max_in_flight` (`null` when unlimited). A project cap is "
"shared by all the project's keys, so a key can get `429` below its own "
"limit."
msgstr ""
"`GET /v1/key` 显示 key 的项目、模型、预算和 `concurrency.max_in_flight`（无上限时为 "
"`null`）。项目的上限由项目内所有 key 共享，所以某个 key 可能在没达到自己的上限时就收到 `429`。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:419
msgid "Deployment shape"
msgstr "部署形态"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:421
msgid ""
"`deploy/docker/` holds `Dockerfile.backend`, `Dockerfile.frontend` (the "
"Next.js console in `apps/frontend/`) and `docker-compose.yml`; systemd "
"units are in `deploy/systemd/`. The console and the API share one origin:"
" console route handlers forward `/v1`, `/anthropic`, `/auth`, `/user`, "
"`/admin` and the published `/internal` paths, and "
"`apps/frontend/next.config.js` rewrites `/health`, `/site-config`, "
"`/site-updates` and `/public-stats`. Together they are [the public path "
"table](public-path-table.md). The frontend has its own quality gates, "
"separate from the Python `make` targets."
msgstr ""
"`deploy/docker/` 中有 "
"`Dockerfile.backend`、`Dockerfile.frontend`（`apps/frontend/` 中的 Next.js "
"控制台）和 `docker-compose.yml`；systemd 单元在 `deploy/systemd/` 中。控制台和 API "
"共用同一个源：控制台的路由处理器转发 `/v1`、`/anthropic`、`/auth`、`/user`、`/admin` 以及公开的 "
"`/internal` 路径，`apps/frontend/next.config.js` 则重写 `/health`、`/site-config"
"`、`/site-updates` 和 `/public-stats`。两者合起来就是[公开路径表](public-path-"
"table.md)。前端有自己的质量检查，与 Python 的 `make` 目标分开。"

