msgid ""
"Diagrams are in [Router types and execution boundaries](routing.md"
"#router-types-and-execution-boundaries)."
msgstr "示意图见[router 类型与执行边界](routing.md#router-types-and-execution-boundaries)。"

#: ../developer/architecture.md:261
msgid ""
"Every router runs its chosen endpoint through a thin wrapper called a "
"leaf. An experimental composition, `HybridRouter`, splits a model's "
"routes into a local and a cloud pool; a model opts in with "
"`router_params.hybrid_composition: true`. See [Hybrid "
"composition](routing.md#hybrid-composition)."
msgstr ""
"每个 router 都通过一层称为 leaf 的薄包装来调用选中的端点。实验性的组合 `HybridRouter` "
"把模型的路由分成本地池和云端池；模型通过 `router_params.hybrid_composition: true` "
"选择启用。见[混合组合](routing.md#hybrid-composition)。"

